{"synopsis":"Namun, Jinhyeok hanya ingin menjalani kehidupan normal bersama keluarga tercintanya, dan dia tidak bisa menyembunyikan perasaan kesepian dan putus asa karena kenyataan bahwa dia tidak bisa melakukannya…\n\nSuatu hari, ketika aku terbangun dalam sebuah kecelakaan, aku kembali ke masa ketika aku berumur 9 tahun, sebelum aku kehilangan orang tua yang sangat kuinginkan!\n\nAkankah Jinhyuk bisa menyelamatkan orang tuanya dan menjalani kehidupan normal?","alternative_title":"The Genius Who Chose a Normal Life, Sang Jenius Yang Memilih Kehidupan Sederhana, The Genius Who Wanted a Normal Life, 천재는 평범하게 살기로 했더","author":"Silk Scallop, Jasone","artist":"Arty","chapters":[{"number":"67","chapter":"67","slug":"b8ccd8e6-2125-47a0-bdcf-7b60e70f489c","title":"Chapter 67","date":"2026-07-30"},{"number":"66","chapter":"66","slug":"0311270b-41d9-41c3-8c32-124385de26aa","title":"Chapter 66","date":"2026-07-11"},{"number":"65","chapter":"65","slug":"dac428d4-a41c-455f-9639-ccfe66e277d8","title":"Chapter 65","date":"2026-07-03"},{"number":"64","chapter":"64","slug":"a2c09c9d-a623-462a-947d-956541d33f50","title":"Chapter 64","date":"2026-07-03"},{"number":"63","chapter":"63","slug":"fb1cf8ee-61b8-44e8-87b5-5ab496b9d207","title":"Chapter 63","date":"2026-07-03"},{"number":"62","chapter":"62","slug":"f96d2151-7de2-402a-b59a-7c68d90c2703","title":"Chapter 62","date":"2026-06-26"},{"number":"61","chapter":"61","slug":"17b015c9-9009-40ce-87b4-693d12117e49","title":"Chapter 61","date":"2026-06-15"},{"number":"60","chapter":"60","slug":"a14d436b-fb6e-4ed2-910a-48cac4e4012a","title":"Chapter 60","date":"2026-06-15"},{"number":"59","chapter":"59","slug":"6544c8fd-cc0b-4162-8fc7-311778fe30a7","title":"Chapter 59","date":"2026-06-14"},{"number":"58","chapter":"58","slug":"245bde3f-f8e0-4301-8819-03303c4c04a9","title":"Chapter 58","date":"2026-05-13"},{"number":"57","chapter":"57","slug":"d1888949-0928-4e0b-becf-90a6b97b8e29","title":"Chapter 57","date":"2026-05-13"},{"number":"56","cha